.* Rendering: a menu with a command line, one without, an information panel.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.Copyright (C) 2026 Quartz Systems
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CMDCL BASETYPE=CMDLINE WIDTH=200.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FLAGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=COMMAND CLASS=CMDCL.
:VAR NAME=MENUID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='QSMAIN'.
:VAR NAME=OPERATOR CLASS=FLAGCL VALUE='N'.
:VAR NAME=PGM CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='QGPL/MYPGM'.
:COND NAME=ISOPR EXPR='&OPERATOR. EQ "Y"'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION=KEYSHELP.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F23 ACTION='RETURN 23'.F23=Set initial menu
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=SELKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=QSMAIN KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAME PANELID=MENUID.Quartz Systems Menu
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Pick one of the entries below:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Everyday tasks
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='PANEL SELWDG'.Widget tasks
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU GENERAL'.General system tasks
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU FILES'.Files and libraries
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU PGMMNU'.Programming
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU CMN'.Communications
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU DEFINE' COND=ISOPR.Define or change the system
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='MENU PROBLEM'.Problem handling
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU DSPMNU'.Display a menu
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU INFO'.Information options
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU ACCESS'.Access tasks
:MENUI OPTION=90 ACTION=EXIT.Sign off
:MENUI OPTION='*' ACTION=CMDLINE.Run the command typed below
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG NAME=COMMAND.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=QSCMDS KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE PANELID=MENUID.Widget Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Pick one of the entries below:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget status WRKWDGSTS
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with active widgets WRKACTWDG
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with alerts WRKWDGALR
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with alert tables WRKWDGTBL
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget jobs WRKWDGJOB
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget pools WRKWDGPOOL
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget status WRKWDGSTS2
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with authority WRKWDGAUT
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget lists WRKWDGL
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with binding WRKWDGBND
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget entries WRKWDGE
:MENUI OPTION=14 ACTION='CALL PGM'.Work with widget classes WRKWDGCLS
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related menus
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='MENU QSMAIN'.Main menu QSMAIN
:MENUI OPTION=21 ACTION='MENU FILES'.Files and libraries FILES
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG NAME=COMMAND.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SELWDG KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAME.Pick a Widget Task
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.Pick one of the entries below:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 1'.Show the widget text
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 2'.Show the widget fields
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.Show the widget attributes
:MENUI OPTION=30 ACTION='RETURN 30'.All of the above
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ABOUT KEYL=SELKEYS TOPSEP=SPACE.About Widgets
:INFO DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:H1.What a widget is
:P.A widget is an object of the library it lives in. Its text, kind,
owner and quantity are shown by the display panel and changed by the
change panel.
:P.Press :PK.F12:EPK. to go back to the menu.
:EINFO.
:TEXT DEPTH=2.
Fixed text under the information area.
:ETEXT.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to go back.
:EPANEL.
:EPNLGRP.
